        <summary lang="en_GB">Test your Internet bandwidth</summary>
        <description lang="en_GB">This add-on tests your Internet bandwidth and reports download and upload speeds and latency from within Kodi. Servers are selected automatically based on your location, or you can pick a city, country or specific server. Use this if you are experiencing streaming issues and suspect your network to be the cause.</description>
