        <news>
v2.0.0 (2026-07-26)
- Modern Ookla server discovery (@TomSzo_HUN)
- Automatic nearest-server selection, city/country/ID search (@TomSzo_HUN)
- Optional download-only mode, prefer-HTTPS, configurable timeout (@TomSzo_HUN)
- Localization for 11 languages incl. Hungarian (@TomSzo_HUN)
- Python 3.9-3.12 / Kodi 19-21 Omega compatibility (@TomSzo_HUN)
